1.3 Group Organization
The twenty-four candidates were divided into five groups, with each group assigned specific responsibilities in managing one production unit (cage).
Group Responsibilities
•	Feeding and watering.
•	Cleaning and sanitation.
•	Vaccination and health monitoring.
•	Record keeping.
•	Marketing and sales.
•	Value addition.
•	Financial management.
This arrangement enhanced teamwork, accountability, leadership skills, and effective management of the enterprise.


